WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.280
Won’t leave

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.080
without a dropkick on her!

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.210
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
-She summoned me, the evil god.
-Evil god!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.770
I gotta kill her or else
What?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.650
I can’t go back to Hell!
Sister...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.360
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw!

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.280
If you go too far,

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:46.280
I’ll slice you up completely!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.540
Your halo!
Must get it back!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:52.660
Never miss a chance
Hey, seriously?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.880
To attack her from behind!
You’re so mean.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:01.130
I’ll never give up.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.760
Yurine, you’re off your guard!

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:06.930
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.850
Huh? What? I missed…

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.270
Can’t leave Earth

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.400
without a dropkick on her!

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:21.570
But until then,

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.490
let’s all have fun together!
Yeah!

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.720
I'm dying!
The "summer" is too hot.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.890
-Endure it.
-No can do.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:01.650
-Endure--
-No can do!

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:06.530
-We are aliens and we come in peace.
-You're a devil.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:11.790
Why don't you have one of those
wind machines in here?

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:16.080
An air conditioner?
We can't afford that.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:20.130
I bet I could get Medusa
to buy us one.

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:24.380
Don't bother.
Just live with the fan.

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:27.470
This lukewarm air
is not gonna cut it!

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:40.060
We would have an air conditioner
if we weren't with Flex Comix.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:41.310
Huh?

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:44.990
The bigger publishers
take good care of their talents.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.830
I'm totally lost!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.870
I'm out! Gonna go cool down
at an electronics shop in Akiba.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:14.560
This...

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.270
is hell...

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.650
It's so hot!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.650
And humid on top of that!

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:27.740
Discomfort index is 100,
no, more like 2020!

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:31.030
I can't believe they're hosting
the Olympics here.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:32.280
It's such a scam.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:36.540
"Omotenashi," my ass!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.170
What's with the dissing?
You're gonna get roasted for that.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:44.710
Shut up. I'll just give up, then.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.630
Fine, I'll make it cooler for you.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.630
Really?

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.520
W-What's this?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:07.190
A punishment.
It's also much cooler now, right?

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.900
I'm sorry. I'm really, really sorry.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.120
It's cooler all right...
It's freezing.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:21.120
It's freezing... I'm so cold...

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.830
Well, that's good isn't it, Jashin-chan?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.170
I won't stand for this!

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.680
Yurine, you're out of your mind.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.060
Then don't act like a brat.

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:41.810
If it's come to this,
I better summon "it" from hell.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.520
"It"?

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.440
Who is this?

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.070
Kori-chan, an Ice Devil.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.070
Kori-chan?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.080
Funny-looking face.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.870
Kori-chan can cool a room
just by being there.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:07.090
-Whoa, it really is cooler in here.
-And check this out!

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:14.050
Instant shaved ice.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.470
Impressive.

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:17.600
So, which flavor?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:18.810
Which?

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.730
Strawberry or lemon?

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:24.100
Then lemon--

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.350
Kori-chan's blood
is strawberry

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:29.610
-and her urine is lemon flavor!
-I'll take strawberry.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.450
It really is strawberry syrup.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:45.580
I eat hot foods in the summer
to intensify the heat!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.710
Ah! It burns!

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:57.220
A cool room and shaved ice.
So convenient.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.760
Very much so.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.560
But it doesn't just end there.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.270
Kori-chan, do that thing you do.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:10.650
You don't want to right now?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.900
Who do you think you are?

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:17.700
A low-class devil like you
must obey me.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:21.160
Just do what I asked. Now!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.910
Easy there, Jashin-chan.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.920
-Snow...?
-Are you impressed or what?

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:38.800
Low-class devils only exist
to entertain us!

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:43.850
You must be honored
to serve a high-class devil like me.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:52.690
The snow's getting heavy.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:56.030
Kori-chan, you can stop now.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.320
That's enough!

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.280
Stop right now, damn it!

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:08.500
Don't push your luck.
I'm done with you, so go home!

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:12.460
Jashin-chan, watch your mouth.
You're being cruel.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:14.210
I am not!

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:17.170
This is what you get
for disobeying me!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.720
Jashin-chan Cho--!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.810
Let me explain.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:28.270
Jashin-chan is relentless to smaller
and weaker low-class devils.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.480
Chop!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:33.650
Let go.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.280
You froze me.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.660
You stupid brat!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:48.000
I’m glad you were able to cool off.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.130
Can she regenerate?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.760
How humiliating.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.090
You deserved it.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.180
WHAT WAS ORIGINALLY CALLED
"JASHIN-CHAN"

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:08.680
SUZURAN SHOPPING DISTRICT

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.950
I'm s-starving.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:30.790
Angels are immortal, but...

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.630
humans are heartless.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:37.880
It's obvious that I'm not okay.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:43.840
My Lord.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:47.260
Humans are completely corrupt now.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.640
Final judgment day

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:52.190
might be coming in the near future.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.530
An a-angel?

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.500
Pekola, are you okay?

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.710
The witch...

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.710
Enter Bondy from the back
of Kanda Used Bookstore.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:24.260
Never enter from the bookstore.

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:28.930
The potato's tasty.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:32.390
But, why do they serve potatoes
at a curry shop?

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:35.270
Eat or talk, just choose one.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.440
Why do they serve potatoes?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.070
Who knows?

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.780
Thank you for waiting.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:53.660
Dig in, curry's best
when it's still hot.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.210
Thank you.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.960
Delicious.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.260
May I have another serving?

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:08.800
Sure, I'll take it from
Jashin-chan's food budget.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.470
One more, please!

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.180
Right away.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:16.230
It's not angel-like of you
to wander around starving.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:17.560
It's very human.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.400
Without my halo,

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.450
I'm no different
than a feeble human.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.950
With my halo,
I can work miracles.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:34.330
Transforming rock into bread,
water into wine.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:40.460
Excuse me, I'm looking for someone.

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:46.470
Do you know if Jashin-chan
lives around here?

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.970
Jashin-chan?

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:51.430
I was sent by my mother from hell

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:55.220
to search for Jashin-chan.

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.440
JINBOCHO POLICE

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.900
Why don't you stay with us
for about three days?

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:03.320
Yeah, you're suspicious.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.990
-But, Jashin-chan--
-Sure, sure.

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.740
Did you eat enough?

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:11.160
Yup, thank you so--

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:18.080
Thanking a witch
means I'm betraying God!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:21.880
But, she treated me
and I even got seconds!

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:25.710
-I've been sinning all this time!
-May I have another serving?

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.760
You talk to yourself too much.

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:31.640
But it's true,
the witch saved my life.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.140
Yurine Hanazono.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:36.640
I've no choice but to thank you.

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:41.940
But, I still haven't given up
on eliminating you and the devils.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:46.730
Just wait. When I find my halo,
and get my powers back,

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:48.820
I'll eliminate you all!

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:56.080
I hope you find your halo soon.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.910
Idiot, weren't you listening
to what I just said?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.540
I get so confused when I'm with you.
I'm going home!

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:06.960
Bless her heart.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:10.630
My Lord, what should I do?

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:13.470
Should I consider her my neighbor,

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.350
even though she’s a witch?

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:18.930
This world is full
of contradictions!

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.820
My Lord,
why did they serve potatoes?

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.030
Jashin-chan?

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.160
100% BEEF

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.870
We're here!

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.330
Jashin-chan?

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:40.410
She invited us
and she's not even here.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.250
Maybe...

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.670
She's in here.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.380
Nope.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:49.420
I usually find her hiding
in here.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.130
I'm right here!

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.260
Trumped you there!

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.010
Medusa's like,

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.770
"I usually find her hiding
in here."

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:01.890
Dumbass!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:05.940
Why would I hide in the same place
over and over again? Idiot.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:09.150
I-I'll check under the floors
next time.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:11.860
But, why were you hiding at all?

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.860
Good question! Let me tell you...

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:20.240
I know! You were testing to see
if it was a good place to hide

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:24.290
for when you go for
a surprise attack on Yurine!

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.250
Oh?

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.000
How'd you know?

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:32.670
Save yourself the effort.
You'll fail again.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.010
-Hey, Minos.
-Yeah?

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:37.800
Convince her to give up
on killing Yurine.

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:40.510
No! I'll never give up!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.890
Off you go. The experiment's over.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.310
Out you go.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.480
Any minute now...

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.070
I'm back.

00:13:56.490 --> 00:14:01.330
I'm hungry. The trident was on sale
today for half off so I bought it.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.620
-Looks like she's not even here.
-What? A trident?

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:05.960
There!

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:09.960
That's a good place
to store it for now.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:13.380
Why would you stab
a trident through the floor?

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.050
She seems clueless.

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:19.850
But who knows.

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:22.890
She might already know
I'm in here.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.100
Let me check.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.980
All right. She really doesn't know.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.320
I'll throw this at her
just for fun.

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:38.030
Ouch.

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:42.830
An avocado...?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.410
I'll eat it later.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.160
She's clueless!

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:48.830
She's gonna eat it later?
What an idiot.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:52.840
At this rate,
I could probably go for it...

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:56.840
I'll sneak up behind her
and use this.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.220
This is the end.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:01.140
Goodbye, Yurine!

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:07.770
YURINE

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.330
H-Hey there.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.250
I see what's going on.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:34.300
I didn't expect to be able to test out
the trident so soon.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.130
T-Trident happy?

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:47.480
Let's "try."

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.850
Well, I knew that was coming.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:53.440
I did my part, I warned her.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:01.660
What is that?

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:05.200
A tomahawk, it was 80 percent off
at the weapon shop.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.380
Hello, Jashin-chan?

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.590
Medusa? Come here now!

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:24.100
-W-Why?
-I'll tell you later!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.600
Jashin-chan?

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:28.890
Excuse me!

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:30.850
Your voice is adorable!

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.100
You sound exactly like Miyutan!

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:34.980
What's with this bag?

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:36.690
N-No! Not my face!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.440
Don't worry! With a cute voice
like yours,

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:42.990
you'll look cute
even if you're not all that!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.630
That's why I told you to stop.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:58.210
I gotta get to Jashin-chan now!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.470
Here you go.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.390
Thank you.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:06.720
Tokyo's a dense city.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.770
I wouldn't worry about
fossilizing one guy.

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:15.060
Anyway, why isn't she here
when she invited you?

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.400
Jashin-chan has no respect.

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.730
I'm pretty used to it.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:23.030
Delicious.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.860
What do you mean?

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.410
Does she always treat
you this bad?

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:30.910
What? Oh no, not really.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:35.120
Really?
So, was she always like this?

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:38.420
Well, let's see...

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:41.590
When we attended Hell Elementary...

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.380
Jashin-chan acted out

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.390
and knocked down a statue
in the courtyard.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.850
Who broke the gargoyle statue?

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.190
She hasn't changed a bit.

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:59.360
But, when Jashin-chan was bullying
a weak devil...

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:03.280
Dumb goblin, you can't
score higher than me!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.740
Stop it, Jashin-chan!

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.990
You're dumb and stupid!

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:10.530
What did my son do to you?

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:13.660
I said no, but Medusa forced me!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.910
No, I didn't!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.000
Good times.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.170
What part?

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:22.590
Oh, yeah, when she fell in a trap...

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.180
All right.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:31.180
-See ya!
-Wait! Don't leave me in here!

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:34.890
They finally found me
after three days.

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:36.350
Another time...

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:41.110
-Do anything to her but let me go.
-No!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.400
Those were the days.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:45.740
-Another time!
-Enough.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.780
You've gone through too much.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.280
Really?

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:50.950
I guess as devils,

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.200
it doesn't matter if you're mean
and cunning.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.040
Hey there! I'm a meanie!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:01.210
Why are you still her friend
even though she betrays you all the time?

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.170
Are you an "M"?

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.930
In any case, Jashin-chan's
still trash.

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:12.970
Actually, she can be pretty cute
at times.

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.680
Whenever she's in trouble,

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:19.600
she relies on me the most!

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:23.860
UNDERWORLD

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:28.610
It's just a devilish perspective!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:29.820
Damn it!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.330
Medusa!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.790
Wait for me!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.380
Don't abandon me!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:45.050
You're the only one
I could count on!

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:48.840
Forgive me for everything
I've done to you.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:53.930
I know you like me, Medusa!

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:03.980
When I see her so vulnerable...

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.940
She makes me think

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:11.490
she can't live without me,
that I need to be there for her.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:19.870
Careful, don't let any losers
take advantage of you.

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.000
O-Okay, I'll be careful.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.130
I'm back!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:26.500
She's home.

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:30.300
Don't go out when you invite
Medusa over.

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:31.930
She doesn't mind.

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:35.850
Medusa's lower in class
so I make her wait.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:39.640
Welcome back, Jashin-chan.
Why did you call me?

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:41.520
This is all the money I have.

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:42.770
10,000 YEN

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:46.520
-Idiot! Not in front of Yurine.
-S-Sorry.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.900
I never asked you for money.

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:54.110
But, if you say so,
I'll happily accept the cash.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:57.030
Then what did you want me for?

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:00.330
If it's illegal in hell,

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.210
I can't help you.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:05.790
We'll handle that later.
I called you for this today.

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:09.420
I won you this at an arcade
in Ikebukuro.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:12.630
You said it was cute last time.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.600
The panda human doll.

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.560
Jashin-chan, you remembered!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:24.520
I won it using your money, Medusa.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.850
Here you go.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:30.570
Thanks so much, Jashin-chan!

00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:37.450
Don't hug me!
Who do you think you are?

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:41.580
I only did it
because it benefits me.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.420
It means nothing more than that.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:48.000
But, I'm still happy!

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:50.590
Stop it! Don't hug me!

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:56.300
It looks like a happy ending.

00:21:56.800 --> 00:21:58.100
But, it's all doomed.

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.140
This looks familiar.

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:01.850
Medusa!

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:05.190
I've seen this before.

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:34.670
Dropkick on her! Yeah her!
I’ll take you down again!

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:39.430
Hate you!
Love doesn’t exist in this world

00:22:40.260 --> 00:22:44.770
Fear the dropkick!
An Angel looks for her halo

00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:48.850
As she starves to death!

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:51.820
It’s a love and hate relationship,

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:54.150
can’t leave each other alone

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:58.820
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star!

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:03.040
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and DIE!

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:05.290
Test my heart, don’t stop

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:12.500
Let’s go! Dream on! No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.710 --> 00:23:16.760
We’re a happy family La la la

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:21.010
Let me say, I love you!!

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:23.350
When all is said and done

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:28.140
I’m home! Welcome back, it’s hot pot tonight!

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:32.860
Come, gather everyone! Let’s enjoy this meal!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:35.070
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:38.650
What next? What next? In the end, Wakeup!

00:23:41.740 --> 00:23:44.950
Winter has come.
The streets are filled with Christmas spirit.

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:49.620
Away from the bustle of the city,
a poor girl cries.

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:54.880
Dropkick on My Devil!
We'll camel clutch your heart in the next episode too!
